                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.00/533: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at San
                        José</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Chase</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-20T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                                1919, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your January 15, 9 p.m.</p>
                <p>Keep Department closely informed concerning situation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
